### List all system messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-messages
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Create error message
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-messages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "text": "Некоторые функции временно недоступны.",
  "type": "error",
  "isActive": true
}

> {%
  client.global.set("systemMessageId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### Change message to info
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-messages/{{systemMessageId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "type": "info",
  "text": "Мы обновили приложение и добавили новые возможности."
}

### Disable message
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-messages/{{systemMessageId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-messages/{{systemMessageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
